===Etymology===
Possibly from {{och-l|曳|id=1|to drag}} ({{zh-ref|Lin, 1999}}; {{zh-ref|Yang, 2000}}; {{zh-ref|Tu, 2019}}) or {{och-l|抴|id=1|to pull}} ({{zh-ref|Tu, 2019}}).

